"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"DMS can keep the content of its files in the database, in the Odoo\n"
"filestore or in existing attachments linked to a record. Only the\n"
"filestore is content-addressed: identical files share the same physical\n"
"file, while the database mode duplicates every copy in PostgreSQL and in\n"
"its backups.\n"
"\n"
"This module adds a pre-installation guard: it refuses to install while a\n"
"DMS storage still keeps its files in the database, or while files are\n"
"waiting for a storage migration, and explains how to migrate them first.\n"
"Once installed, the same diagnosis is available from a dedicated screen.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Use Cases / Context\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"The DMS addons can keep the content of a document in the database, in\n"
"the Odoo filestore or in existing attachments. The filestore is\n"
"content-addressed: identical contents are stored once, while the\n"
"database mode duplicates every copy in PostgreSQL and in its backups.\n"
"\n"
"On a database that already holds documents, installing a storage-related\n"
"module without checking the storage mode hides silent costs: a larger\n"
"database, heavier backups, slower restores, and files whose storage type\n"
"no longer matches the storage configuration.\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"No external dependency.\n"
"\n"
"The module refuses to install while a DMS storage keeps its files in the\n"
"database, or while files are waiting for a storage migration, and\n"
"explains how to migrate them first (Documents > Configuration > System >\n"
"Storages).\n"
"\n"
"On a database that uses demo data, the check only logs a warning so the\n"
"module can still be installed for tests. To install anyway on another\n"
"database, set the system parameter\n"
"``dms_storage_guard.allow_database_storage`` to ``1``.\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"The check runs before the installation and blocks it when a storage\n"
"needs an action. It is bypassed automatically on a database that uses\n"
"demo data.\n"
"\n"
"To install anyway on another database, set the system parameter\n"
"``dms_storage_guard.allow_database_storage`` to ``1``.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"Open *Documents > Configuration > System > Storage Check* to see:\n"
"\n"
"- the state of every storage (mode, files, pending migrations);\n"
"- the space used and the space saved by the filestore deduplication;\n"
"- the documents sharing the same content (duplicates);\n"
"- the filestore integrity (attachments referenced in the database and\n"
"  files really present on disk).\n"
"\n"
"Known issues / Roadmap\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"- Offer the remediation actions from the screen itself (migrate a\n"
"  storage, open a duplicate document, purge the unreferenced files after\n"
"  the garbage collection).\n"
"- Report the storage usage per storage instead of the whole database.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/dms/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/dms/issues/new?body=module:%20dms_storage_guard%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
